### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john6@gmail.com",
  "password": "abcd1234"
}


### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users


### Get User By ID - to fetch the address - onlly user 12 has the address
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/12

### Get User By ID - to fetch the address - onlly user 12 has the address
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/2


### Update User
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Johnnnnn",
  "lastName": "Smithhhhhhhhhh",
  "email": "john22@gmail.com",
  "password": "abcd1234"
}


### Update User By Email
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/update?email=john22%40gmail.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith"
}


### Delete User By ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/4


